#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.h2:104-9
msgid "Shortcut Keys for Tables"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມລັດສຳລັບຕາຕະລາງ"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:106-38
#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:267-84
#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:332-91
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>A</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>A</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:106-144
msgid ""
"If the active cell is empty: selects the whole table. Otherwise: selects the "
"contents of the active cell. Pressing again selects the entire table."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຊ່ອງປັດຈຸບັນຫວ່າງເປົ່າ: ຈະເລືອກທັງຕາຕະລາງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ: "
"ຈະເລືອກເນື້ອໃນຂອງຊ່ອງປັດຈຸບັນ. ກົດອີກຄັ້ງຈະເລືອກທັງໝົດຕາຕະລາງ."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:107-147
msgid ""
"If the active cell is empty: goes to the beginning of the table. Otherwise: "
"first press goes to beginning of the active cell, second press goes to "
"beginning of the current table, third press goes to beginning of document."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຊ່ອງປັດຈຸບັນຫວ່າງເປົ່າ: ຈະໄປທີ່ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຕາຕະລາງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ: "
"ກົດຄັ້ງທຳອິດຈະໄປທີ່ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຊ່ອງປັດຈຸບັນ, "
"ກົດຄັ້ງທີສອງຈະໄປທີ່ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຕາຕະລາງປັດຈຸບັນ, "
"ກົດຄັ້ງທີສາມຈະໄປທີ່ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງເອກະສານ."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:108-146
msgid ""
"If the active cell is empty: goes to the end of the table. Otherwise: first "
"press goes to the end of the active cell, second press goes to the end of "
"the current table, third press goes to the end of the document."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຊ່ອງປັດຈຸບັນຫວ່າງເປົ່າ: ຈະໄປທີ່ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຕາຕະລາງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ: "
"ກົດຄັ້ງທຳອິດຈະໄປທີ່ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຊ່ອງປັດຈຸບັນ, "
"ກົດຄັ້ງທີສອງຈະໄປທີ່ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຕາຕະລາງປັດຈຸບັນ, "
"ກົດຄັ້ງທີສາມຈະໄປທີ່ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງເອກະສານ."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:109-38
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Tab</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Tab</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:109-146
msgid ""
"Inserts a tab stop (only in tables). Depending on the Window Manager in use, "
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Tab</kbd> may be used instead."
msgstr ""
"ແຊກຈຸດຢຸດແຖບ (ສະເພາະໃນຕາຕະລາງ). ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງ (Window Manager) "
"ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ, ອາດຈະໃຊ້ <kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden="
"\"true\">+</span><kbd>Tab</kbd> ແທນ."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:110-38
msgid ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Arrow Keys</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>ປຸ່ມລູກສອນ</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:110-152
msgid ""
"Increases/decreases the size of the column/row on the right/bottom cell edge"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ/ຫຼຸດຂະໜາດຂອງຖັນ/ແຖວຢູ່ຂອບຂວາ/ລຸ່ມຂອງຊ່ອງ"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:111-38
msgid ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Arrow Keys</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>ປຸ່ມລູກສອນ</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:111-219
msgid "Increase/decrease the size of the column/row on the left/top cell edge"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ/ຫຼຸດຂະໜາດຂອງຖັນ/ແຖວຢູ່ຂອບຊ້າຍ/ເທິງຂອງຊ່ອງ"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:112-38
msgid ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Arrow Keys</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>ປຸ່ມລູກສອນ</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:112-218
#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:113-285
msgid "Like Alt, but only the active cell is modified"
msgstr "ຄືກັບ Alt, ແຕ່ຈະແກ້ໄຂສະເພາະຊ່ອງທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:113-38
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</"
"span><kbd>Arrow Keys</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>ປຸ່ມລູກສອນ</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:114-38
msgid ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Insert</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Insert</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:114-148
msgid ""
"3 seconds in Insert mode, Arrow Key inserts row/column, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span "
"class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><kbd>Arrow Key</kbd> "
"inserts cell"
msgstr ""
"3 ວິນາທີໃນໂໝດແຊກ, ປຸ່ມລູກສອນຈະແຊກແຖວ/ຖັນ, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--"
"plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><kbd>ປຸ່ມລູກສອນ</kbd> ຈະແຊກຊ່ອງ"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:115-38
msgid ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Del</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Alt</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Del</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:115-145
msgid ""
"3 seconds in Delete mode, Arrow key deletes row/column, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span "
"class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><kbd>Arrow key</kbd> merges "
"cell with neighboring cell"
msgstr ""
"3 ວິນາທີໃນໂໝດລຶບ, ປຸ່ມລູກສອນຈະລຶບແຖວ/ຖັນ, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--"
"plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><kbd>ປຸ່ມລູກສອນ</kbd> "
"ຈະຮວມຊ່ອງເຂົ້າກັບຊ່ອງຂ້າງຄຽງ"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:116-38
msgid ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Del</kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Shift</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span class=\"kbd--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\""
">+</span><kbd>Del</kbd>"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td.p:116-235
msgid ""
"If no whole cell is selected, the text from the cursor to the end of the "
"current sentence is deleted. If the cursor is at the end of a cell, and no "
"whole cell is selected, the contents of the next cell are deleted."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການເລືອກເຕັມຊ່ອງ, "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກເຄີເຊີໄປຫາຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງປະໂຫຍກປັດຈຸບັນຈະຖືກລຶບ. "
"ຖ້າເຄີເຊີຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຊ່ອງ, ແລະ ບໍ່ມີການເລືອກເຕັມຊ່ອງ, "
"ເນື້ອໃນຂອງຊ່ອງຕໍ່ໄປຈະຖືກລຶບ."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td.p:117-1
msgid ""
"If no whole cell is selected and the cursor is at the end of the table, the "
"paragraph following the table will be deleted, unless it is the last "
"paragraph in the document."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການເລືອກເຕັມຊ່ອງ ແລະ ເຄີເຊີຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຕາຕະລາງ, "
"ຫຍໍ້ໜ້າທີ່ຕາມຫຼັງຕາຕະລາງຈະຖືກລຶບ, "
"ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າມັນເປັນຫຍໍ້ໜ້າສຸດທ້າຍໃນເອກະສານ."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td.p:118-1
msgid ""
"If one or more cells are selected, the whole rows containing the selection "
"will be deleted. If all rows are selected completely or partially, the "
"entire table will be deleted."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເລືອກໜຶ່ງຊ່ອງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ, ທັງໝົດແຖວທີ່ມີສ່ວນທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຈະຖືກລຶບ. "
"ຖ້າທຸກແຖວຖືກເລືອກທັງໝົດ ຫຼື ບາງສ່ວນ, ທັງໝົດຕາຕະລາງຈະຖືກລຶບ."

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.h2:123-9
msgid "Word processor functions"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຂອງໂປຣແກຣມປະມວນຜົນຄຳ"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:125-69
msgid "Insert footnote"
msgstr "ແຊກອ້າງອີງທ້າຍໜ້າ"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:126-68
msgid "Insert endnote"
msgstr "ແຊກອ້າງອີງທ້າຍເອກະສານ"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:127-71
#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:182-71
msgid "Insert comment"
msgstr "ແຊກຄຳເຫັນ"

#: html/cool-help.html%2Bdiv.div.div.table.tr.td:129-71
