#~ msgid ""
#~ "<span class=\"def\">The menu bar:</span> The main menu is placed on the top "
#~ "and includes many options, commands for printing, editing, viewing and other"
#~ " advanced commands. You can hide the menu bar clicking on the <span "
#~ "class=\"w2ui-icon fold icon-size\"></span> icon on the far right. Click on "
#~ "the <span class=\"w2ui-icon unfold icon-size\"></span> icon to show the "
#~ "menu."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<span class=\"def\">ແຖບເມນູ:</span> ເມນູຫຼັກຈະຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງ ແລະ "
#~ "ລວມມີຕົວເລືອກຫຼາຍຢ່າງ, ຄຳສັ່ງສຳລັບການພິມ, ການແກ້ໄຂ, ການເບິ່ງ ແລະ "
#~ "ຄຳສັ່ງຂັ້ນສູງອື່ນໆ. ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອງແຖບເມນູໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນ <span "
#~ "class=\"w2ui-icon fold icon-size\"></span> ຢູ່ທາງຂວາສຸດ. ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນ <span "
#~ "class=\"w2ui-icon unfold icon-size\"></span> ເພື່ອສະແດງເມນູ."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<span class=\"def\">The information bar:</span> At the right of the search "
#~ "bar, a set of information on the document is displayed. The actual "
#~ "information depends on the nature of the document."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<span class=\"def\">ແຖບຂໍ້ມູນ:</span> ຢູ່ທາງຂວາຂອງແຖບຄົ້ນຫາ, "
#~ "ຊຸດຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບເອກະສານຈະຖືກສະແດງ. "
#~ "ຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບລັກສະນະຂອງເອກະສານ."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Click on the clone formatting icon <img class=\"icon-size\" alt=\"\" "
#~ "src=\"images/lc_formatpaintbrush.svg\" />. The mouse pointer turns to a "
#~ "paint bucket."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນສຳເນົາຮູບແບບ <img class=\"icon-size\" alt=\"\" "
#~ "src=\"images/lc_formatpaintbrush.svg\" />. ຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ຈະປ່ຽນເປັນຖັງສີ."
